<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: bold; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-label { flex-basis: 30%; }
  .form-input { flex-basis: 65%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; width: 50%; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">Office of Student Financial Assistance</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 0;">ACADEMIC YEAR</h2>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 0;">2020-2021</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Student's Name:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Address:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">City:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Email Address:</div>
      <div class="form-input"><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-label" style="flex-basis: 30%;">Date:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-basis: 30%;"><span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="flex-basis: 30%;">State/Zip:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-basis: 30%;"><span data-field="state_zip">{{ state_zip }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div class="form-label">Phone:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">
    The income reported to IRS for tax purposes may be adjusted for financial aid purposes. In some instances, the amount of income listed on the tax return includes income that is not counted for financial aid purposes. In addition, child support paid by the student and spouse (if married) is deducted from income because that money is not available for educational purposes or normal living expenses.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">
    We are unable to continue processing your financial aid because your 2020-2021 FAFSA contains conflicting information. To resolve this discrepancy, you must complete this worksheet. If you are married report information for both you and your spouse.
  </p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">1. 2018 Education credits from IRS Form 1040 Schedule 3—line 50. _________________________</h3>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span data-field="education_credits_2018">{{ education_credits_2018 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">Student/Spouse</h3>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">2. Child support paid in 2018 because of divorce or separation or as a result of a legal requirement. Do not include support for children already listed in your household</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">A) Name(s) & age(s) of the children for whom these payments were paid in 2018:</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Name</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Age</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in child_support_children %}
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_children[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ item.name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_children[{{ loop.index0 }}].age">{{ item.age }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-header">B) Name of the person to whom child support was paid</div>
  <div class="form-input" style="width: 100%;"><span data-field="child_support_recipient_name">{{ child_support_recipient_name }}</span></div>

  <div class="section-header">C) Name of the person who paid child support</div>
  <div class="form-input" style="width: 100%;"><span data-field="child_support_payer_name">{{ child_support_payer_name }}</span></div>

  <div class="section-header">D) Total child support amount paid in 2018. _________________________</div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <span data-field="total_child_support_amount">{{ total_child_support_amount }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">3. Did you report earnings from need-based employment programs, such as Federal Work-Study and need-based employment portions of fellowships and assistantships as income on your 2018 tax return?</div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <span data-field="earnings_reported_yes">{{ earnings_reported_yes }}</span>
    <span data-field="earnings_reported_no">{{ earnings_reported_no }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    If yes, please provide the amount reported. _________________________
    <span data-field="earnings_amount">{{ earnings_amount }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">4. Did you report college grant and scholarship aid, including AmeriCorps benefits (awards, living allowances and interest accrual payments), as well as grant and scholarship portions of fellowships and assistantships as income on your 2018 tax return?</div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <span data-field="aid_reported_yes">{{ aid_reported_yes }}</span>
    <span data-field="aid_reported_no">{{ aid_reported_no }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    If yes, please provide the amount reported. _________________________
    <span data-field="aid_amount">{{ aid_amount }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">5. Did you report combat pay or special combat pay on your 2018 tax return?</div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <span data-field="combat_pay_reported_yes">{{ combat_pay_reported_yes }}</span>
    <span data-field="combat_pay_reported_no">{{ combat_pay_reported_no }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    If yes, only report the amount that was taxable and included in your adjusted gross income. Please attach all 2018 w-2 forms
    <span data-field="combat_pay_amount">{{ combat_pay_amount }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">6. Did you report earnings from work under a cooperative education program offered by a college on your 2018 tax return?</div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <span data-field="coop_earnings_reported_yes">{{ coop_earnings_reported_yes }}</span>
    <span data-field="coop_earnings_reported_no">{{ coop_earnings_reported_no }}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    If yes, please provide the amount reported. _________________________
    <span data-field="coop_earnings_amount">{{ coop_earnings_amount }}</span>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 50px;">
    By signing this form, I certify that the information provided on this form is complete and correct to the best of my knowledge.
  </p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 80px;">
    <div>
      Student's Signature: _________________________
    </div>
    <div>
      Date: _________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px; font-size: 9pt; text-align: right;">
    Student_exclusion-2021-Rev 05/20
  </div>
</div>